flowchart LR
  Buy[Purchase exactly eight real identities] --> Seats[Assign actual retained v02 seat positions / rear-to-front exit order]
  Seats --> Driver[Separate supplier driver remains supplier-owned]
  Seats --> Prep[Measured opposite-feet preparation / actual stand clearance]
  Prep --> Rear[Stand / walk through cleared rear rows / crouch]
  Rear --> Push[Approved v02 supported push-off / extend legs before flight]
  Push --> Jump[One actual jump and landing / retain aboard custody until ground contact]
  Jump --> Clear[Previous passenger clears actual rear landing zone]
  Clear --> Next[Next rear-to-front passenger]
  Jump --> Walk[Same identity walks to actual arrival point]
  Walk --> Admit[Actual arrival changes owner/population once]
  Clear -->|last passenger| Depart[Carrier may request clear departure]
  Admit --> Gate[Every arrival plus actual departure required for order gate]
  Depart --> Gate
  Clock[Receiving activity deadlines / no animation callbacks change custody] -.-> Prep
  Clock -.-> Push
  Clock -.-> Jump
  Pause[Pause freezes activity time and pose / hidden view keeps domain progressing] -.-> Clock
